        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Data Structure Card",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:3}\n• **Card Information**: ID, Card Number, Card Mask, Status, Sequential Number, Issue Date, Expiration Date, PIN Update, Previous Card Number, Product ID, Product Name.\n• **Customer Information**: Customer Number, Category, Nationality, Resident.\n• **Cardholder Information**: Cardholder Name, Country, Postal Code, Communication Method/Address, Full Name, Birth Date, Place of Birth, Gender.\n• **Identity Information**: ID Number, ID Issue Date, ID Expire Date.\n• **Account Information**: Account Number, Account Type, Account Status, Currency.\n• **Limit Information**: Sum Limit, Currency.",
          "color": "#06b6d4",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
